        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Malkovich, David Zayas, John Dahl, Matt Damon, Edward Norton\n- Films: Rounders, Empire of the Sun, The Killing Fields, Con Air, Of Mice and Men, Ripley's Game, Knockaround Guys, Being John Malkovich, Shadow of the Vampire, Burn After Reading, RED, Mulholland Falls, Dangerous Liaisons, Warm Bodies, Ghost World, Juno, The Perks of Being a Wallflower, Annie\n- Television series: Dexter, Oz, Gotham\n- Topics: film acting, film producing, poker drama\n\nFacts:\n- John Malkovich has appeared in films including Empire of the Sun, The Killing Fields, Dangerous Liaisons, Con Air, Of Mice and Men, Rounders, Ripley's Game, Knockaround Guys, Being John Malkovich, Shadow of the Vampire, Mulholland Falls, Burn After Reading, RED, and Warm Bodies.\n- Rounders is a 1998 American drama film about the underground world of high-stakes poker.\n- Rounders was directed by John Dahl and stars Matt Damon and Edward Norton.\n- David Zayas played Osborne the cop in Rounders (1998).\n- David Zayas is best known for playing Angel Batista on Dexter, Enrique Morales on Oz, Lou the bodega owner in Annie (2014), and Sal Maroni on Gotham.\n- John Malkovich has also produced the films Ghost World, Juno, and The Perks of Being a Wallflower.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
